@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam linetype ortho

[*] --> ReadyForPickup : kitchenReady

ReadyForPickup --> Assigned : assignShipper
Assigned --> OutForDelivery : scanHubPickupQR
OutForDelivery --> ArrivedAtCustomer : arriveAtAddress

ArrivedAtCustomer -right-> Delivered : confirmHandover & codPaid
ArrivedAtCustomer -left-> FailedDelivery : timeoutUnreachable > 10m

Delivered --> [*]
FailedDelivery --> ReturningToHub : initiateReturnTrip
ReturningToHub --> [*] : packageReturned

@enduml